      "content": "it's just so exhausting. pretending to be \"present\" when there's nothing left inside. it feels like i'm just performing a role for a world that doesn't even notice. if the story is already over and there's no more substance left to write, what's the point of dragging out the epilogue? it just feels like an endless, hollow loop.",
